{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 04 · BACKEND SERVER ROOM — local service",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -1350,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## BACKEND SERVER ROOM\n**VERIFIED (software)** — 10/10 pytest green\n**No physical terminal has ever talked to this.**\n[[04 - Backend Server Room/Backend Server Room.md]]",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -1190,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "g003",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "THE PATH OF ONE EVENT",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -1350,
      "width": 2100,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ESP32**\nWrites LittleFS **first**",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -1270,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Wi-Fi**\n2.4 GHz LAN",
      "x": 370,
      "y": -1270,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**POST /api/v1/attendance**\n`Bearer <device token>`",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -1270,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**BEGIN IMMEDIATE**\nserialised write transaction",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": -1270,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**COMMIT**\n201 RECORDED\n200 DUPLICATE_SUPPRESSED",
      "x": 1490,
      "y": -1270,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**SQLite**\nWAL",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": -1270,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**uuid seen?** → return stored outcome, no insert · **slot > capacity?** → 409 · **no ACTIVE student in slot?** → 409 · **accepted scan within 60 s?** → DUPLICATE_SUPPRESSED · else RECORDED",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -1120,
      "width": 1330,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#0f766e"
    },
    {
      "id": "g011",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "IMPLEMENTED ROUTES  —  real code, real tests",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": -960,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 900,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`GET /health`**\n`none` — opens + migrates the DB, returns schema_version; 503 if unavailable",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -880,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 105,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`GET /api/v1/students`**\n`Admin Basic` — filters, bounded pagination 1–100",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -765,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 105,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t014",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`POST /api/v1/students`**\n`Admin Basic` — reserves the lowest free slot on the sole active device; audited",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -650,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 105,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t015",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`GET /api/v1/students/{uuid}`**\n`Admin Basic` — one student; no token or template fields",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -535,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 105,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t016",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`POST …/students/{uuid}/deactivate`**\n`Admin Basic` — blocks slot resolution; slot is **not** freed",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 105,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t017",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`GET …/devices/{uuid}/enrollment/{student}`**\n`Device Bearer` — reserved slot, pending students only",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -305,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 105,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t018",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`POST …/enrollment/{student}/complete`**\n`Device Bearer` — idempotent activation; exact retry is a no-op",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -190,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 105,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t019",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`POST /api/v1/attendance`**\n`Device Bearer` — idempotency + 60-second duplicate rule",
      "x": -970,
      "y": -75,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 105,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "g020",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "PLANNED — no code, no tests",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -900,
      "width": 2100,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "t021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "device list · device detail · cleanup · heartbeat · attendance query · daily report · CSV export · SSE stream · static dashboard serving",
      "x": 30,
      "y": -830,
      "width": 2040,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "#525252"
    },
    {
      "id": "g022",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "DATABASE  —  schema v1",
      "x": -1000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t023",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`devices`**\n`device_uuid` · `token_hash` · `sensor_capacity`",
      "x": -970,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t024",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`students`**\nidentity · `status` · `fingerprint_slot_id`",
      "x": -540,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t025",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`attendance_events`**\n`event_uuid` UNIQUE → idempotency",
      "x": -970,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t026",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**`admin_audit_log`**\nactor · action · target",
      "x": -540,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#6d28d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "t027",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "WAL · `synchronous=FULL` · `foreign_keys=ON` · `busy_timeout=5000`\nmigrations contiguous from `001`, version re-read **after** the write lock.\n**Slot references only — never a template or an image.**",
      "x": -970,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 870,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "g028",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "AUTH, CONFIG, AND THE TRUST BOUNDARY",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2100,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t029",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Admin** — HTTP Basic\n`hmac.compare_digest` against env credentials\n`ADMIN_PASSWORD` ≥ 16 chars, fail-fast at startup",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t030",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Device** — HTTP Bearer\nSHA-256 hash compared in `devices`\ntoken printed **once** by `provision_device`",
      "x": 690,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#b91c1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "t031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Error envelope**\n`{\"error\":{code,message,correlation_id}}`\nno SQL, no traceback, no secret, no biometric payload",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "t032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "`sensor_capacity` must be a **verified** number. The CLI refuses a non-positive value but cannot verify physics — do not invent a capacity to make provisioning succeed. R307S capacity is disputed: 1000 (datasheet) vs 300 (retail).",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 230,
      "width": 2040,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#92400e"
    },
    {
      "id": "t033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "```\ncd backend\n.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m pytest tests -q            # 10 passed\n.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000\n```",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 2040,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#15803d"
    },
    {
      "id": "g034",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "SOURCE + DOCUMENTS",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
